WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
The Aral Sea.

2
00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:04.550
Once the 4th largest lake in the world.

3
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.810
It shrank.

4
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.510
Fisheries collapsed.

5
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:11.310
Salty dust from the exposed
bed settled on the fields.

6
00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:16.830
In 2014, the eastern lobe of the
South Aral Sea completely disappeared.

7
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.130
What drained it?

8
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.570
Climate change alone?

9
00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.950
An earthquake that cracked its bed?

10
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.670
Factories polluting it
until it evaporated?

11
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.770
In this mission, you'll map a falling
aquifer under eight US states,

12
00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:32.030
and a desert city that pumped too hard.

13
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:36.830
Then you'll check a dramatic claim:
is Lake Chad really disappearing?

14
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.280
Your mission: find out
what drained the Aral Sea.
